<title>KUWAIT: Kuwait's Burgan Bank '96 net.</title>
<headline>Kuwait's Burgan Bank '96 net.</headline>
<dateline>KUWAIT 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>			    (Million dinars unless stated)</p>
<p>					1996	   1995</p>
<p> Net profit		     10.542	  7.686</p>
<p> Net interest income	  10.340	  8.357</p>
<p>Profit available for</p>
<p>appropriation		   12.055	  8.980</p>
<p> Dividend per share (dinar)  0.012	  0.008</p>
<p>Full name: Burgan Bank S.A.K.</p>
<p>Note: The figures were announced by the Kuwait Stock Exchange as presented by the bank before ratification of its general assembly.</p>
</text>
